player_prompt.intro:
Yin ee Player {player_id} ee 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Match ee dhieth {num_rounds} rounds.
Koc ee round:
• {conv_rounds} akuen kek thiaan
• 1 akuen kek bany - cuet akuen tok per opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' ku '[<opp-id> defect]' (kec. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default ee 'cooperate'). 
Matrix ee payoff ee riinic (applied ee koor ee unordered pair):
  - Koor ee cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Koor ee defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Yin defect, kek cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Yin cooperate, kek defect -> {sucker}
Player(s) ee adhieth score ee koor ee rounds aacuei ee win.
